@startuml MyBattleship_UseCase_Battle
title MyBattleship - Use Case Detail: Take Turn, Abilities and Game Over

left to right direction
skinparam packageStyle rectangle
skinparam nodesep 12
skinparam ranksep 70
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #F5F9FF
  BorderColor #33567F
}
skinparam actorStyle awesome

actor Attacker
actor Defender
actor Timer

rectangle "MyBattleship System" {

  package "The turn" {
    usecase "Take Turn" as UC_Turn
    usecase "Fire Shot" as UC_Fire
    usecase "Auto-fire on Timeout" as UC_Auto
    usecase "Resolve Shot" as UC_Resolve
    usecase "Sink Ship" as UC_Sink
    usecase "Game Over / Rematch" as UC_Win
  }

  package "Abilities" {
    usecase "Use Ability" as UC_Ability
    usecase "Radar Sweep" as UC_Radar
    usecase "Line Scan" as UC_Line
    usecase "Double Shot" as UC_Double
    usecase "Reroute" as UC_Reroute
    usecase "Grant Ability" as UC_Draw
    usecase "Keep or Replace Ability" as UC_Keep
  }
}

Attacker -- UC_Turn
Timer -- UC_Auto
Defender -- UC_Keep

' ---------- Extend ----------
UC_Fire .> UC_Turn : <<extend>>
UC_Ability .> UC_Turn : <<extend>>
UC_Sink .> UC_Resolve : <<extend>>
UC_Win .> UC_Resolve : <<extend>>
UC_Keep .> UC_Draw : <<extend>>

' ---------- Include ----------
UC_Auto ..> UC_Fire : <<include>>
UC_Fire ..> UC_Resolve : <<include>>
UC_Sink ..> UC_Draw : <<include>>

' ---------- Generalisation ----------
UC_Ability <|-- UC_Radar
UC_Ability <|-- UC_Line
UC_Ability <|-- UC_Double
UC_Ability <|-- UC_Reroute

legend right
  |= Use case |= Note |
  | Actors | Attacker and Defender are roles of Player and swap each turn. The AI fills either role |
  | Take Turn | Both branches are conditional: an ability only if one is held, a shot unless an ability used it |
  | Fire Shot | An already-targeted square cannot be selected and does not end the turn |
  | Resolve Shot | A hit fires again; a miss passes the turn |
  | Sink Ship | The shot hit the last undamaged cell of a ship |
  | Grant Ability | Always on. Goes to the owner of the sunk ship, drawn on the server, one held at a time |
  | Keep or Replace Ability | Only when the Defender already holds an unused ability |
  | Radar Sweep | 3x3 area inside the board with at least one unshot square; ship squares highlighted green to the scanner only |
  | Line Scan | A row or column with at least one unshot square; ship squares highlighted green to the scanner only |
  | Double Shot | Does not use the turn's shot: the next miss that turn does not end it |
  | Reroute | Moves one undamaged ship to a valid position the opponent has not targeted; redrawn if none exists |
  | Game Over / Rematch | All opposing ships sunk, a forfeit, or a 60 s disconnect. Rematch needs both; the AI always accepts |
endlegend

@enduml